# Git History Analysis Rule

When the user asks about git history, code changes, regressions, or branch comparisons, use the `git-history-analyzer` skill from `.cursor/skills/git-history-analyzer/SKILL.md`.

## Trigger Phrases
- "What changed in..." / "Co się zmieniło w..."
- "Compare branches" / "Porównaj branche"
- "When was this introduced" / "Kiedy to dodano"
- "Who changed this" / "Kto to zmienił"
- "Show me the history" / "Pokaż historię"
- "Find the commit that broke" / "Znajdź commit który zepsuł"
- "Review changes" / "Przejrzyj zmiany"
- "What happened between" / "Co się stało między"

## Key Commands
- `git log --oneline -S"term"` — Find when a term was added/removed
- `git diff main...HEAD --stat` — Changes on current branch vs main
- `git blame <file>` — Line-by-line authorship
- `git log --follow -p -- <file>` — Full file history with diffs
- `az repos pr list` — Azure DevOps PR listing
